Simulation complete.
Test Program
The instruction memory is initialized with a simple test program:

text
addi x1, x0, 5      # x1 = 5
addi x2, x0, 10     # x2 = 10
add  x3, x1, x2     # x3 = 15
sub  x4, x2, x1     # x4 = 5
and  x5, x1, x2     # x5 = 0
or   x6, x1, x2     # x6 = 15
xor  x7, x1, x2     # x7 = 15
nop                 # pipeline flush
Results
