Critical path reduction	18% (via logic restructuring)
Pipeline stages	5
Hazard coverage	Forwarding + stall + flush
Debug & Verification
Waveform: rv32i.vcd generated by testbench, view with GTKWave

Forwarding: EX/MEM and MEM/WB paths verified with dependent instructions

Load-use stall: Inserted when load followed by dependent instruction

Branch flush: IF/ID and ID/EX cleared on taken branch

